          %p
            then we discussed how this is the local (“rational”) expression for a higher WZW term for a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sigma-model"} sigma-model
            of a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/p-brane"} p-brane
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+%28physics%29"} field
            configuration of that sigma-model is hence a map as on the left of
          .maruku-equation
            %math#mathml_a0136b00a59018dc879e6912a866dd696f262538_102.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
