            for this sigma model. By repeating the reasoning, this is given in turn by (if it exists nontrivially) a higher WZW term given by a higher
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/L-%E2%88%9E+cocycle"} L-∞ cocycle
            %math#mathml_a0136b00a59018dc879e6912a866dd696f262538_120.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
