            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-group"} ∞-group
            looks as follows (
            %a{:href => "#FRS13a"}> FRS 13a
            ):
          .maruku-equation
            %math#mathml_a0136b00a59018dc879e6912a866dd696f262538_135.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi QuantMorph
